WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
[Mappe logo]
Mappe, personal product, 2026. My job search needed a product.

00:04.500 --> 00:09.500
The problem: applications in a sheet, replies in Gmail, PDFs in folders.

00:09.500 --> 00:15.500
Dashboard: summary first, then the list. What needs action sits next to the numbers.
[The dashboard, with demo data. Interface in Portuguese.]

00:15.500 --> 00:21.500
Detail: one sheet per application, with status, next step and timeline. Every change is one tap away.

00:21.500 --> 00:27.500
Daily search: a search every morning. Claude looks for jobs and drops them in an inbox, and I decide to apply or discard.

00:27.500 --> 00:32.500
On the phone: the same system, in my pocket.

00:32.500 --> 00:38.000
Under the hood: 1 job search by Claude every day, 3 inbox checks for replies a day, 16 automated tests on every push.

00:38.000 --> 00:42.000
Designed, built and used by me. React, TypeScript, Supabase.
